README.md:197:| [#32031](https://codexissues.com/issue/32031-critical-ux-regression-multi-agent-v2-spawn-agent-hides-model-overrides-and-reje) (OPEN) | V2 `spawn_agent` hides model overrides (`hide_spawn_agent_metadata` defaults true) and full-history forks reject model overrides | **Config workaround**: this package pins models in the agent TOML files (highest-priority static guarantee) and leaves `multi_agent_v2` unset (V1 semantics). If you must use V2: set `[features.multi_agent_v2] hide_spawn_agent_metadata = false` and always spawn with `fork_turns: "none"` + explicit model/effort. |

